# Line-ending policy
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Biome formats with LF (its default `lineEnding`). Without this file, a Windows
# checkout gets CRLF working-copy files and `npm run format:check` reports every
# source file as unformatted — 347 failures that have nothing to do with code
# style, which made `npm run verify` permanently red locally while passing in CI.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalizes to LF in the repository AND in the working copy,
# so the formatter, the linter and CI all agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
